{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act16d5_level_act16d5_04_beg",
  "groupId": "act16d5",
  "stageId": "act16d5_04",
  "title": "掌櫃",
  "storyCode": "WR-4",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act16d5/level_act16d5_04_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "afc9b23eebfaf277d6f2de2d8973c2dc1762822762ffe0f9b0b7f8518cd51ecf",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "還有人沒離開這兒嗎！趕緊去先生那兒躲著！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "往東邊走，快！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "......自從留意到天色之後就意識到，這裡真的是越往西邊走越靠近黑夜呢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "這麼說的話，我們現在是“從正午走向黃昏”？還挺有詩意誒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "......還是不對，這“白天到黑夜”的距離也太短了，我們才走了幾步路？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "畫卷長短時有變化，各處景象光怪陸離，畫中人為自己的天地尋了一份規矩，但說到底，也是假的。這也是在所難免的事情嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "所以我說——等等，什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "呃？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "你剛才說——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "唔啊啊啊——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "——！還有人沒離開這兒嗎！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "在這裡！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "救、救命！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "莫怕，小僧來也！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "text": "嘎——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "唔，果不其然，被斬之後便化作墨漬，怪哉怪哉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "大師，好身手哇！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "莫要掉以輕心，姑娘，你趕緊往東邊去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "好，好！你們也要小心啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "......似乎還有不少來不及逃走的村民。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "可能是太過突然，反應不及——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "text": "爸爸？媽媽？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "那、那邊有個孩子！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "不好——快趴下！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "來不及了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "text": "嗚嗚......嗚啊啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "text": "啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "唔哦，千鈞一髮！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "沒受傷吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "text": "嗚嗚嗚......沒......嗚嗚嗚......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "剛才......剛才是不是有什麼東西刺穿了那玩意的喉嚨......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "是克洛絲，真是刁鑽的角度。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "她，她在哪兒？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "別找了，找不到的，只要知道她在就足夠了，得優先保證所有村民都離開這片黑夜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "嚯，當真好默契，真讓小僧大開眼界。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "text": "嗚嗚......嗚嗚嗚......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "但、但我們要帶著這個小姑娘一起走？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "......你先帶她離開這裡，送去安全的地方，沒問題吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "沒問題！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "但是——我實在不忍拋下恩人，獨自避難呀！不能陪著恩人拋頭顱灑熱血，多可惜——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "你可以先把孩子送去煮傘先生那裡，然後再回來找我們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "啊哈哈......欸......好的，我會的，會的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "小妹妹，跟哥哥走好不好呀？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "text": "嗚......嗚嗚......叔叔，你看見我媽媽了嗎......嗚嗚......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "哥哥帶你去找媽媽好不好？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "text": "嗚......嗯......謝謝叔叔......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "......咳。恩人呐，那我，先走一步？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "先生，只靠嵯峨和那三位英雄，沒問題嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "text": "先生？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "text": "......無妨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民甲",
      "text": "怎麼回事啊？先生今天是不是心情不好？昨天忘了睡覺啦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民乙",
      "text": "先生溫文爾雅，不像是個喜怒無常的人呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民甲",
      "text": "一定是先生為我們勞神操心，累了吧，我們應當多為他著想點，讓他睡著吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "六根清淨！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "text": "嘎啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "斬卻煩惱！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "text": "嘎啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "油炸豆腐！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "text": "嘎，嘎啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "......你還挺厲害的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "小僧自幼在寺廟長大，耳濡目染，稍微學了些刀法罷了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "你這叫稍微？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "莫要在意，待小僧為炎熔施主開出一條道來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "text": "嘎......嘎啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "那些怪物已經開始怕你了......說起來，墨魎是有智慧的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "text": "嘎！嘎啊！嘎啊嘎啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "唔？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "怎麼停手了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "text": "嘎，嘎嘎啊，嘎啊嘎啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "嗯，嗯嗯，嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "喂！？你還能聽懂這玩意說話的！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "略通一二。施主你看，這一隻墨魎也沒犯什麼過錯，若是真心悔過，不再侵擾鎮上鄰里，放了就放了罷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "text": "嘎啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "......這樣好嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "沒關係，小僧自有分寸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "text": "嘎......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "這附近安靜些了......應該沒有其他村民留在這裡，現在我們可以談談了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "炎熔施主好生嚴肅，莫非小僧做錯了什麼嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "這倒沒有，只是你剛才說了......畫卷？你似乎對這裡很瞭解。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "那可不，小僧在此地雲遊，也有段時間了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "這地方看上去可不值得“雲遊”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "一幅畫卷，能有多大？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "什麼意思......我們在畫裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "正是如此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "......到底什麼意思？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "啊，小僧明白了，幾位施主和小僧一樣，也是誤入此中山河——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "呃？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "想當初，小僧只是途經大炎勾吳地界，突發奇想，想去拜訪一下那位大家後人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "見灰齊山飛瀑之下美不勝收，就在一處山中茅屋露宿一宿，沒想到眼睛一閉一睜，就到這裡來啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "等、等等，什麼意思，你也是來找“夕”的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "夕？小僧倒未曾聽說過這個名諱......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "小僧尋的，是那位“一筆拙山起，何處話風流”的炎國畫家。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "不過算算時日，怕那畫家已經不在人世了，故而想去探訪其故居，如此而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "反正你也是先去大炎勾吳灰齊山，然後莫名其妙就到了這裡的，對吧！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "唔，確是如此不假，但施主為何如此激動？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "然後你說這裡是畫卷——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "天地人皆不合情理，炎熔施主，沒有意識到嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "這我也知道，可為什麼是畫......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "小僧也難說明白，不過這婆山鎮，已經是小僧遊歷的......大概百餘幅畫卷啦！至少自己身在何處，還是心知肚明的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "可......那些人，是活生生的人，茶水有滋味，水果也能吃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "只是某種法術的結果嗎？可如果這是法術的結果......這是什麼樣的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "這小僧可就毫無頭緒了。要不是曾有幸一瞥這天地真實，小僧怕也意識不到自己身在何處吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "此處沒有天災所擾，各界生靈，都遵循著自己的規矩，自成方圓，妙不可言。小僧留在這裡，未嘗沒有圖個安心的意思。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "這......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "哈哈，看施主一臉困惑，也在所難免，小僧初見夕娥的時候，也是施主這般模樣......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "慢著......你說見誰！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "小僧見了——等等，那處燈火，莫非是掌櫃的當鋪？她竟然沒去避難，這可不成！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "等等我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌櫃",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "text": "嘎唔......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌櫃",
      "text": "......好了好了，別這麼激動。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌櫃",
      "text": "為什麼要來嚇唬人？她是怎麼說的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌櫃",
      "text": "啊......是這樣......她還是老樣子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "掌櫃的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌櫃",
      "text": "......去吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "text": "嘎......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "掌櫃的，你沒事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌櫃",
      "text": "我沒事的......這位就是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "哦，這位施主就是炎熔，是之前傳得沸沸揚揚的外來者。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌櫃",
      "text": "幸會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "這位是這間當鋪的老闆娘，單名一個“黎”字，黎明的黎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "......你沒有被奇怪的東西襲擊嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "不曾見過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "text": "黎姑娘，不知那些墨魎是不是還會回來，可否讓我們躲藏在此處，觀察一二？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "......嗯，好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
